{"kind": "mod", "id": 1416, "name": "Default Fire Mode Fixer", "slug": "default-fire-mode-fixer", "teaser": "Fixes weapons to default to full auto instead of single fire.\r\nShotguns default to double instead of single if available.\r\nSMGs default to Full Auto over Single / Burst", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 14037, "favourites": 18, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.acidphantasm.defaultfiremode", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-09T18:02:46.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-05-17T19:34:48.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-05-17T19:34:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "2.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>This mod was built to be extremely simple with as little impact as possible. It just sorts the weapFireType by key length, which makes for a much better sorting system for the fire types than default.</p>\n<p>If you want this to impact non-vanilla weapons, you will need to adjust your load order to put this mod below the custom weapon mods.</p>\n<p><strong>This only impacts weapons that you buy from traders and find in raid.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>SPT will still remember your previous FireMode selection on raid exit and set it accordingly on the weapon.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Same with AI in raid, if they switch to Single Fire, it will be Single Fire until it’s changed in raid.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-defaultfiremode</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 708, "published_at": "2024-05-17T19:34:48.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1416/default-fire-mode-fixer/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1450, "published_at": "2024-07-06T20:34:22.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1416/default-fire-mode-fixer/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1428, "published_at": "2024-11-26T15:05:46.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1416/default-fire-mode-fixer/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3218, "published_at": "2025-03-15T20:26:10.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1416/default-fire-mode-fixer/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 4561, "down